From e2ef93b3b8f6d252eb97bb2d1b9968963c836f6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:44:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] retain Board alarm provenance across rehome

Read server-owned alarm_source independently of operational created_on; preserve NULL legacy fallback and explicit empty refusal. Pull the field but never capture it; include it in the local prefilter and repin reader. Board counterpart: daveey/hermes-hub#179. No historical backfill or scalar tuning.

Proof: test-first identity/repin 6 failures, sync 2 missing-field failures, prefilter 1 provenance failure, fake Board 1 missing stamp. Canonical focused and consumer suites and scripts/check passed. Deployment is gated on owner Q2 rollout decision; this commit alone has no warm-upgrade refill.
